<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>Casual Slides · WebPC</title></head><body>
<header><strong>Casual Slides</strong><span id="status" role="status">Opening editor…</span><nav aria-label="Browser storage"><button id="backup" disabled>Backup JSON</button><button id="open" disabled>Open JSON…</button><button id="recover" disabled>Recover previous</button><button id="retry" disabled>Retry save</button><button id="raw" hidden>Download stored data</button><button id="help">Help</button></nav></header>
<p id="error" role="alert" hidden></p><p id="legacy" hidden>Your earlier composer deck is preserved. <button id="legacy-download">Download earlier deck JSON</button> It uses a different format; keep this backup for reference.</p>
<iframe id="slides-editor" title="CasualOffice Slides editor" src="/pc/vendor/slides/index.html#editor" allow="fullscreen; clipboard-read; clipboard-write"></iframe>
<input id="file" type="file" accept=".json" hidden/>
<dialog id="help-dialog"><h1>CasualOffice Slides</h1><p>This is the upstream Slides editor. Use its File menu to open or export PPTX, insert text, shapes and images, arrange slides, edit speaker notes, and present.</p><p>Edits save in this browser. Export important work regularly. New/Open keep one previous browser save under Recover previous. JSON backups preserve the editor snapshot. Earlier composer decks remain untouched and have a separate JSON download.</p><p>PPTX conversion may change unsupported formatting, fonts or features. Available fonts are hosted locally; other fonts use substitutions. Collaboration is disabled. Browser storage has a size limit: if a save fails, keep this window open and export a backup or PPTX.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/CasualOffice/slides/tree/48397c257d8a67917990471f54a6e31bd15a51b4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pinned upstream source</a> · <a href="/third-party/casual-slides/README.txt" target="_blank">Licenses and integration notes</a></p><form method="dialog"><button>Close help</button></form></dialog>
<script>import '../../../../../scripts/pc/slides/app.mjs';</script>
</body></html>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#28313c;background:#f5f6f8;color-scheme:light;--panel:#fff;--line:#d2d9e3}html[data-theme=dark]{color:#e8e9f1;background:#1d2030;color-scheme:dark;--panel:#292d40;--line:#464c65}*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden}body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:12px}header{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:6px 10px;background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}nav{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-left:auto}button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #9682ff}#slides-editor{border:0;flex:1;min-height:0;width:100%;background:white}#error,#legacy{padding:7px 12px;margin:0;background:#fff0cc;color:#624207}dialog{max-width:550px;max-height:85vh;overflow:auto;background:var(--panel);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;line-height:1.6;padding:24px}dialog::backdrop{background:#0009}h1{font-size:20px}a{color:#8e78d9}@media(max-width:600px){header{gap:5px}nav{margin:0}button{font-size:11px;padding:4px 5px}}
